# Shadcn Vue Component Rules

## Installation and Setup

### Initial Installation
```bash
# Install shadcn-vue CLI
pnpm add -D shadcn-vue

# Initialize shadcn-vue in your project
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest init
```

### Project Configuration
The init command will create:
- `components.json` - Configuration file
- `lib/utils.ts` - Utility functions (cn helper)
- `components/ui/` - Directory for UI components

## Component Registration Pattern

### Global Registration (Recommended for frequently used components)
```ts
// src/main.ts
import { createApp } from 'vue'
import App from './App.vue'

// Import commonly used shadcn components
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'
import { Input } from '@/components/ui/input'
import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from '@/components/ui/card'

const app = createApp(App)

// Register components globally
app.component('UiButton', Button)
app.component('UiInput', Input)
app.component('UiCard', Card)
app.component('UiCardContent', CardContent)
app.component('UiCardHeader', CardHeader)
app.component('UiCardTitle', CardTitle)

app.mount('#app')
```

